{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kegan is a dark fantasy action RPG that follows the journey of a skilled dual-blade warrior driven by vengeance, loss, and the weight of a legacy he never chose. After witnessing the destruction of his village and the death of his father\u2014once the king of Valengard\u2014Kegan sets out to uncover the truth behind the mysterious artifact known as the Heart of Eternity, and to destroy the cult that seeks to unleash its deadly power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717150/extras/fea14f92e5dc31b9d108995be3e8ef8a.poster.avif?t=1751378684\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717150/extras/fea14f92e5dc31b9d108995be3e8ef8a.mp4?t=1751378684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a richly detailed medieval world filled with danger, political intrigue, and ancient magic. From cursed forests to forgotten ruins, every corner of the world holds secrets, enemies, and allies. Engage in fast-paced, visceral combat that blends precision, agility, and brutal swordplay using Kegan\u2019s signature dual-blade technique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717150/extras/344baf581c38357173bee4a30bab1b6a.poster.avif?t=1751378684\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717150/extras/344baf581c38357173bee4a30bab1b6a.mp4?t=1751378684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form bonds with unforgettable characters, face morally complex choices, and carve your own path through a world on the brink of shadow. Will you become a beacon of hope\u2014or embrace the darkness to destroy it from within?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embrace your destiny. Face your past. And fight for a future worth saving.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717150?t=1751378684","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717150?t=1751378684","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717150/340b62d851dc366d02909f3a54145c7be7d844f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751378684","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717150/340b62d851dc366d02909f3a54145c7be7d844f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751378684","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3827380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kegan is a dark fantasy action RPG that follows the journey of a skilled dual-blade warrior driven by vengeance, loss, and the weight of a legacy he never chose. After witnessing the destruction of his village and the death of his father\u2014once the king of Valengard\u2014Kegan sets out to uncover the truth behind the mysterious artifact known as the Heart of Eternity, and to destroy the cult that seeks to unleash its deadly power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717150/extras/fea14f92e5dc31b9d108995be3e8ef8a.poster.avif?t=1751378684\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717150/extras/fea14f92e5dc31b9d108995be3e8ef8a.mp4?t=1751378684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a richly detailed medieval world filled with danger, political intrigue, and ancient magic. From cursed forests to forgotten ruins, every corner of the world holds secrets, enemies, and allies. Engage in fast-paced, visceral combat that blends precision, agility, and brutal swordplay using Kegan\u2019s signature dual-blade technique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717150/extras/344baf581c38357173bee4a30bab1b6a.poster.avif?t=1751378684\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717150/extras/344baf581c38357173bee4a30bab1b6a.mp4?t=1751378684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form bonds with unforgettable characters, face morally complex choices, and carve your own path through a world on the brink of shadow. Will you become a beacon of hope\u2014or embrace the darkness to destroy it from within?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embrace your destiny. Face your past. And fight for a future worth saving.</p>","developers":["TDOG STUDIOS"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717150/e8f35291e51077f20a054752dfb261444b6b96f5/header.jpg?t=1751378684","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"h